  "description": "Evelyn was forced to run an errand for cookies because her sister was trying to reconcile with her fiancé. But for some reason, the cookie, called a \"love potion,\" ended up being eaten by her male friend, Kyle. Furthermore, the potion actually contained a libido-stimulating ingredient, and perhaps because of this, Kyle unleashed an unexpected, wild desire on Evelyn...? \n\n*\"You wouldn't turn me into a beast and pretend not to notice, would you?\"*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: The fourth story in Daewon's Neungyong Romance Danpyeon (능욕로맨스단편) Collection.*",
